f23900422df7b1a5849ff68f6c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"182ec71645d5178e72d602a0f11456f628fab173ef514b45a96786ed77a2096e","logical_entry_identity":"00b5e7ed656621b45c1f8be45af4ce99ae9d16327ccd522930774d93ca754f79","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Cease to Exist","source_tag":"_t","target":"存在抹杀"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2cc335c7c6738b66709ec637624be569d8cc7e449321a96c51195a3fe1288db5","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"182f811df1141f7bcd3f581f62a21b0de220e7b1d320b460c7f7555844df5f19","logical_entry_identity":"6cb72a5565ec25788f61d4f111ee259e37ce155e99bc7c159677904b26707d46","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Fortress Gladium","source_tag":"_t","target":"堡垒竞技场"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6f1d4690c5f1d0d798d56a9d9a5d0ef27e841a7f900a4f0b83a831e6b90f961b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1845066997b80d5884477ee92a92aadb5e40ed494e0638f1162add95a0bb8a57","logical_entry_identity":"21405ba6a8a0070cb7c0054a6f15b8aa21d1e6f27571fee89e3cc144ed780556","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This sword appears weightless, and nearly invisible.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这把剑飘渺无形。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"99e521c3abd1a112647a2ba042740854e89104d982c94bc9f6444e1d71d7b5dd","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1850e9ac53cf5b97e137ffb71df478e80070d53bcd3f6c92f0942f6889966a97","logical_entry_identity":"e11e5c5f8b0aaaa21f53625f8c2cad082ecb9a847b89d0800f2a9e28f7906a9e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Chasms go deep, yes yes. More relics found, oh yes. Will be mighty profitable! But ah, my secret treasure is even better, indeed! Gold! Beautiful lovely gold, buried deep, so deep... Have kept it hidden, sealed, yes. Looks like the remains of a giant throne. I touched it, yes, I even put my lips to it - ahhh, the taste!\n\nBut must stay focussed, much work to be done. Miners are rowdy, hrm! One of the drem fools went mad and killed himself with a pickaxe - messy business. Must restore order, yes yes! More Sher'Tul artifacts found, possibly even remains of weapons. Imagine the profit! Will keep them hidden yes, the dreams say yes, in the darkness, secret, waiting waiting, for the right time...\n\nHmm, that fellow's blood was so red, spilling on the cavernous floor. I wonder where they buried him? My mouth... it wants to taste, yes yes...\n\n-- Foreman Tamoth","source_tag":"_t","target":"裂谷通向深处，是的是的。发现了更多遗物，哦，是的。一定会带来巨额利润！但是啊，我的秘密宝藏更好，真的！金子！美丽可爱的金子，埋得很深，那么深……我一直把它藏着，封闭起来，是的。看起来像一座巨大王座的残骸。我摸过它，是的，我甚至用嘴唇贴过它——啊啊啊，这滋味！\n\n但必须保持专注，还有很多工作要做。矿工们躁动不安，嗯！一个德瑞姆傻瓜发了疯，用鹤嘴锄杀死了自己——真麻烦。必须恢复秩序，是的是的！又发现了更多夏·图尔造物，甚至可能还有武器残骸。想想那利润！要把它们藏起来，是的，梦里也是这么说的，藏在黑暗里，秘密地，等等，等到正确的时机……\n\n嗯，那家伙的血真红，洒在洞穴地面上。他们把他埋到哪儿了？我的嘴……它想尝尝，是的是的……\n\n——工头 塔马斯"}],"fixed_source_identity":"commit:624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63","rendered_briefing":"WP2-Lite surface screen; review only","rules_version":"production-review-v2-lite-rules-v2","terminology_snapshot":"9c5578a9655e6dd80db73e1cd996c97dce1bee4abd5e219636a19c81f80a7672"}}